        {
            "id": "1020301",
            "objective": "Talk to Jean",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "102030101",
                    "speaker": "Jean",
                    "text": "*sigh* Klee is no ordinary child. In fact, she holds the title of Spark Knight within our ranks."
                },
                {
                    "id": "102030102",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "No way! Even Klee gets to be a Knight of Favonius!?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "102030103",
                            "text": "Paimon sounds jealous...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "102030105",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Yes! Paimon thinks this is quite unjust!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "102030106",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Although... The name kinda makes sense considering what Klee's treasure does."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "102030107",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "Yes. She causes her fair share of trouble for the Knights of Favonius, but we care a great deal about her."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "102030108",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "As for her background..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "102030109",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "In short, you will understand her more as time goes by."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "102030110",
                                    "speaker": "Jean",
                                    "text": "#Please keep an eye on her in the future, {NICKNAME}."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "102030104",
                            "text": "Sounds more impressive than \"Honorary Knight.\""
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "1020302",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "102030201",
                    "speaker": "Klee",
                    "text": "*sob* I'll be more careful next time..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "102030202",
                    "speaker": "Klee",
                    "text": "Next time, I'll complete a big heroic adventure all by myself, and I'll do it safely!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "102030203",
                    "speaker": "Klee",
                    "text": "I've heard that the Adventurers' Guild has its own set of rules. I wonder if I could get them to..."
                },
                {
